The file "image" holds one line: the container image reference, by tag, that
matches the version of the epistle-panel package. The design is that epistle reads
it to add the panel service to the stack it generates; the epistle release that
does so does not exist yet. There is no digest because the image
digest is not known when the package is built. Do not edit the file; apt
replaces it on upgrade and deletes it on removal.
